{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SVz2jsp1tw1795478309.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受東北季候風影響，本港今日天氣逐步轉涼，市區氣溫由約21度，逐步下降至晚上最低約19度，新界再低一、兩度。</p><p></p><p>天文台科學主任岑翊琳指出：「預期受到東北季候風和雲帶影響，預期未來一兩天早晚清涼，市區最低氣溫約16度左右，新界再低兩、三度。」</p><p></p><p>天文台又預料，到本周後期天色逐漸好轉，氣溫回升，最低氣溫約19度，最高約26度。內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。天文台提醒市民，要留意天氣變化，注意保暖。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T00:43:13.972989+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T00:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T06:28:18.812264+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T00:36:39.953143+00:00","content_hash":"c04e5845279bdc7571580ff66412f2c45c3ca9e632e7d6b6ba6b3e7455a961fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T00:43:13.972989+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}